<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>slidescraper — スライド閲覧デモ</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light dark;
      --bg: #fbfbfd;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --border: #dfe1e6;
      --text: #1b1d20;
      --muted: #6b7280;
      --accent: #2f6feb;
      --danger-bg: #fdeceb;
      --danger-text: #8c1d18;
      --radius: 10px;
    }

    @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
      :root {
        --bg: #14161a;
        --surface: #1c1f24;
        --border: #2e333b;
        --text: #e8eaed;
        --muted: #9aa2ad;
        --accent: #6c9bff;
        --danger-bg: #3a1d1b;
        --danger-text: #ffb4a8;
      }
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 2.5rem 1.25rem 4rem;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text);
      font: 16px/1.6 system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", "Hiragino Sans",
            "Noto Sans JP", sans-serif;
    }

    .wrap { max-width: 68rem; margin: 0 auto; }

    header h1 { margin: 0 0 .25rem; font-size: 1.5rem; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
    header p { margin: 0 0 2rem; color: var(--muted); }

    form {
      display: flex;
      gap: .5rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 1rem;
    }

    input[type="url"] {
      flex: 1 1 22rem;
      padding: .7rem .9rem;
      font: inherit;
      color: var(--text);
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
    }

    input[type="url"]:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
      outline-offset: 1px;
    }

    button {
      padding: .7rem 1.4rem;
      font: inherit;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--accent);
      border: 0;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .providers { margin: 0 0 2rem; color: var(--muted); font-size: .875rem; }
    .providers code {
      padding: .1rem .4rem;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 5px;
    }

    .error {
      padding: .9rem 1.1rem;
      margin-bottom: 2rem;
      background: var(--danger-bg);
      color: var(--danger-text);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
    }

    .deck-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    }

    .deck-meta h2 { margin: 0 0 .25rem; font-size: 1.2rem; }
    .deck-meta p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .9rem; }
    .deck-meta a { color: var(--accent); }

    .view-toggle {
      display: flex;
      flex: none;
      padding: 2px;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
    }

    .view-toggle button {
      padding: .35rem .9rem;
      font-size: .875rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--muted);
      background: transparent;
      border-radius: calc(var(--radius) - 3px);
    }

    .view-toggle button[aria-pressed="true"] {
      color: #fff;
      background: var(--accent);
    }

    .slides {
      display: grid;
      gap: 1rem;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .slides[data-view="grid"] {
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fill, minmax(15rem, 1fr));
    }

    /* Continuous read: one column, page-sized, centred. */
    .slides[data-view="scroll"] {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 52rem);
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .slides li {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .slides img {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      background: var(--bg);
    }

    .slides .slide-link {
      display: block;
      cursor: zoom-in;
      /* An image that fails to load — an expired signed URL, a blocked
         referrer — would otherwise collapse its tile to nothing, leaving a
         page that cannot be seen or clicked. */
      min-height: 4rem;
      background: var(--bg);
    }

    .slides .slide-link:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--accent);
      outline-offset: -2px;
    }

    .slides .n {
      display: block;
      padding: .4rem .7rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .8rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    /* Lightbox ---------------------------------------------------------- */

    .lightbox {
      width: 100vw;
      max-width: 100vw;
      height: 100dvh;
      max-height: 100dvh;
      padding: 0;
      border: 0;
      background: transparent;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .lightbox::backdrop { background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .82); }

    /* Only when open: dialog:not([open]) must keep the UA's display:none. */
    .lightbox[open] {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    .lightbox img {
      display: block;
      width: auto;
      height: auto;
      /* Leave room either side so the arrows sit beside the slide rather
         than on top of its content. */
      max-width: min(100vw - 9rem, 110rem);
      max-height: 92dvh;
      border-radius: 6px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, .5);
    }

    .lightbox button {
      position: fixed;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      color: #fff;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .45);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .25);
      border-radius: 999px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .lightbox button:disabled { opacity: .25; cursor: default; }

    .lb-close {
      top: 1rem;
      right: 1rem;
      width: 2.5rem;
      height: 2.5rem;
      font-size: 1.5rem;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .lb-nav {
      top: 50%;
      width: 3rem;
      height: 3rem;
      font-size: 2rem;
      line-height: 1;
      transform: translateY(-50%);
    }

    .lb-prev { left: 1rem; }
    .lb-next { right: 1rem; }

    .lb-counter {
      position: fixed;
      bottom: 1rem;
      left: 50%;
      margin: 0;
      padding: .3rem .9rem;
      color: #fff;
      font-size: .85rem;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, .55);
      border-radius: 999px;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
    }

    /* On a phone there is no room for gutters, so the arrows overlay the
       slide edges instead. */
    @media (max-width: 40rem) {
      .lightbox img { max-width: 96vw; max-height: 84dvh; }
      .lb-nav { width: 2.5rem; height: 2.5rem; font-size: 1.5rem; }
      .lb-prev { left: .35rem; }
      .lb-next { right: .35rem; }
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 3rem;
      padding-top: 1.25rem;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: .85rem;
    }
    footer a { color: var(--accent); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="wrap">
    <%= yield %>
    <footer>
      <p>
        画像は各サービスのオリジナル URL をそのまま参照しています（再ホストはしません）。
        JSON API: <code>/api/decks?url=...</code> ・
        <a href="https://github.com/ngram/slidescraper">GitHub</a>
      </p>
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
